ences, companies across entertainment, sports and advertising are finding something increasingly valuable offline: audiences willing to show up, spend more and stay engaged.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p \r\nstyle=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> The live experiences economy is creating new sources of pricing power, advertising revenue and audience loyalty, making IRL an increasingly important growth strategy.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:18px;letter-spacing:normal\">&nbsp;</p><p \r\nstyle=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\">The latest members-only <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47236791.321440/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PWNsb3NlcjA4MjcyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aGfa1068aa\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0068a5;\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Media Trends Executive</strong></a> deep dive examines what corporate leaders should watch, including:</span></p><ul \r\nstyle=\"line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:17px\"><li><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><strong>Premium experiences are expanding pricing power. </strong>Fans are continuing to pay for VIP access, upgraded seating and exclusive moments, giving companies a path to increase revenue per attendee.</p></li><li><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\">\r\n<strong>Live audiences are attracting more ad dollars. </strong>As attention online shrinks, brands are investing in out-of-home and experiential marketing that connects with fans in real time.</p></li><li><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><strong>Sports rights are becoming an even more valuable media asset. </strong>Rising rights fees, streaming ad demand and growing interest in women’s sports are creating new upside well beyond ticket sales.\r\n</p></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;mso-line-height-alt:25.5px;letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 17px;\"><strong>Go deeper:</strong> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47236791.321440/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PWNsb3NlcjA4MjcyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aHfa1068aa\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #0068a5;\" rel=\"noopener\">Media Trends Executive</a> give business leaders a closer look at the deals, business models and strategic shifts shaping media’s next growth era.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></table>\r\n<table class=\"button_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47236791.321440/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1zYWlsdGhydSZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsX21hcmtldGluZyZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bXRlX2FjcXVpc2l0aW9uJnV0bV9jb250ZW50PWNsb3NlcjA4MjcyNg/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aIfa1068aa\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\"><!--[if mso]>\r\n<v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\"  href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47236791.321440/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU